===persian===

همیشه باران
برای روییدن نیست...
گاه پنجه‌های باران...
نسیم را می‌نوازد...
و گاه... همراهِ تند باد...
ویرانه می‌کند...
نگاهِ تو پنجره‌ای‌ست
به خاطرهٔ خواستن...
با هم ساختن... با هم سوختن نیست....
عشق...
در سرزمینِ شوق می‌رویاند...
و در دشتِ هوس خشک می‌کند...
ای ابرِ بی‌قرار...
این بار... ساقهٔ شوقم...
من را دوباره نگاه کن...
۱۳۶۹/۱۲/۲۴

===machine===

Rain is not always
for growing...
Sometimes the fingers of the rain...
play upon the breeze...
and sometimes... alongside the gale...
they make a ruin...
Your gaze is a window
onto the memory of wanting...
To build together... is not to burn together....
Love...
makes things grow in the land of longing...
and dries them up in the plain of appetite...
O restless cloud...
this time... my stalk of longing...
look at me again...
1369/12/24

===lantern===

Rain is not always for growing...
Sometimes the fingers of the rain
play over the breeze,
and sometimes, riding the gale,
they leave a ruin behind...
Your looking is a window
onto the memory of wanting...
To build together is not to burn together....
Love
makes things grow in the country of longing
and dries them up on the plain of appetite...
O restless cloud —
this time... my stalk of longing...
look at me again...

1369/12/24

